an></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>A <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Religion Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Religion\" title=\"Religion\">Religion</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> happens when reading, succeeding it is required to decipher its meaning.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Most of the text has been scoured away by time, but what remains appears to be some form of ritual incantation.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n<i>Your white ribs the pillars\n</i></p><p><i><br>\nYour bleached skull the dome\n</i></p><p><i><br>\nTake on <a href=\"/wiki/Apostle_of_Myrkul\" title=\"Apostle of Myrkul\">Apostle's</a> final form\n</i></p><p><i><br>\nCathedral wrought of blessed bone</i>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223846\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1511/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25087/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6348/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua mem